*Heading
** Fixture: a 100 mm by 50 mm IM7/8552 [0/45/-45/90]s plate of 50 S4R elements, clamped along one short edge, under a pressure of 0.002 MPa
** on its top face and an edge load of 5 N/mm pushing into the opposite edge. Units: mm-MPa.
** Laid out the way Abaqus/CAE 2025 writes a model (keyword order, spacing, internal sets, a density, strengths as five positive values, the
** instance moved and then turned 90 degrees about z), after files it wrote on 2026-11-17 (ADR-0105 amendment 1). Written by hand, not by Abaqus/CAE.
** Material values from the public library dataset ncamp-im7-8552-2019-rtd-measured-v1, as the other fixture decks; G23 is a nominal 3000 MPa and
** the density a nominal 1.6e-09 t/mm3, which no result uses.
*Preprint, echo=NO, model=NO, history=NO, contact=NO
